    <!--
        Sonatype Central Portal, not the OpenMRS or Mekom Nexus.

        Overridden deliberately: the inherited distributionManagement still pointed at
        nexus.mekomsolutions.net, which is a plain Nexus without the staging, checksumming and
        signature requirements Central enforces, so a `mvn deploy` against it would produce
        artifacts that are accepted locally and rejected on upload.

        Central Portal ignores <distributionManagement> entirely — org.sonatype.central:
        central-publishing-maven-plugin uploads to the Portal API using a user token, so there is
        nothing to point at here. The block is removed rather than repointed so that a stray
        `mvn deploy` fails loudly instead of silently publishing to the wrong place.
    -->



